1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,564
Welcome to media E R P.

2
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:10,326
This short guide shows the coordinator
workflow, step by step.

3
00:00:10,951 --> 00:00:14,755
Sign in with your work email and password.

4
00:00:18,012 --> 00:00:20,893
As a coordinator you see every team.

5
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:24,451
The Overview shows all work in one place.

6
00:00:25,113 --> 00:00:27,473
Teams is your main area.

7
00:00:27,513 --> 00:00:30,684
Every team in the company is listed here.

8
00:00:31,308 --> 00:00:32,974
Press New Team.

9
00:00:33,014 --> 00:00:36,926
Give it a name, a short description, and a
colour.

10
00:00:37,553 --> 00:00:39,705
Now the important part.

11
00:00:39,745 --> 00:00:43,518
Under Team Leaders, choose who will lead this
team.

12
00:00:44,126 --> 00:00:48,081
Under Team Members, add the people who will
work in it.

13
00:00:48,632 --> 00:00:50,101
Press Create.

14
00:00:50,141 --> 00:00:55,361
The team is ready, and the leader can start
assigning work immediately.

15
00:00:55,976 --> 00:00:58,695
Open a team to see its members.

16
00:00:58,735 --> 00:01:01,258
The crown marks the team leader.

17
00:01:01,873 --> 00:01:06,545
Open a member to see their tasks, and the time
they have tracked.

18
00:01:07,113 --> 00:01:11,924
Projects shows every task, from every team, on
one board.

19
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:18,574
Filter by team, by status, by member, or by
date, to find anything quickly.

20
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:21,766
Press Add Task to create work.

21
00:01:21,806 --> 00:01:26,146
Choose the team, the person, a due date, and a
priority.

22
00:01:26,778 --> 00:01:29,184
Media Schedule is the plan.

23
00:01:29,224 --> 00:01:33,333
Shoots, filming days, and reviews, on a
timeline.

24
00:01:33,972 --> 00:01:40,022
You can add, edit, or remove entries, so every
team knows what is coming.

25
00:01:40,593 --> 00:01:43,381
Chat has a group for every team.

26
00:01:43,421 --> 00:01:46,616
Use it to share updates and files.

27
00:01:47,255 --> 00:01:52,483
Every evening, a daily report is posted
automatically for each team.

28
00:01:53,047 --> 00:01:57,525
Users lists everyone, with their role and
designation.

29
00:01:57,565 --> 00:02:00,250
Coordinators can view this list.

30
00:02:00,832 --> 00:02:03,273
The bell shows notifications.

31
00:02:03,313 --> 00:02:06,866
Important updates also go to your email.

32
00:02:07,481 --> 00:02:10,003
That is the coordinator workflow.

33
00:02:10,043 --> 00:02:14,216
Build teams, assign leaders, and track
everything.

34
00:02:14,256 --> 00:02:15,575
Thank you.
